  "name": "Bathymetry of the Bering Strait - Chukota to Diomede Island",
  "description": "Bathymetric contours of the Russian side of the Bering Strait at 1:1,000,000 scale. Digitized from the \"Topographic and Bathymetric Map of the Northern Bering Sea region\" (USGS Prof. Paper 759-B, 1976)\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: This coverage was created to support marine mammal and bird research at the Alaska Biological Science Center.",
